        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5052MYL, Myles Lever with Modern Rectangular Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Myles Lever with Rectangular Rosette has a two-piece design that has risen in popularity in the last few years for its sleek, contemporary look. This Modern Myles Leverset with Rectangle Rose is available in a wide array of popular finishes. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. The Myles Lever with Modern Rectangular Rose will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-MYL-specifications.gif?v=1704354621\" width=\"600\" height=\"119\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Myles Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Contemporary Myles Door Lever with Modern Rectangle Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Myles Leverset with Rectangular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Stem Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-MYL-specifications.pdf?v=1704262369\"><b>Emtek Myles Lever Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Myles Lever with Rectangular Rosette",
                "description": "The Myles Lever with Rectangular Rosette has a two-piece design that has risen in popularity in the last few years for its sleek, contemporary look. This Modern Myles Leverset with Rectangle Rose is available in a wide array of popular finishes. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. The Myles Lever with Modern Rectangular Rose will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.",
                "keywords": "Modern Myles Leverset with Rectangle Roses, Myles Lever with Rectangular Rosettes,  Emtek 5052MYL dummy lever, EMT-5052MYL, EMT-5112MYL, EMT-5212MYL, Emtek 5112MYL passage lever, Emtek 5212MYL privacy lever, Myles Lever with Modern Rectangular Roses, Modern Myles Leverset with Rectangular Roses, Contemporary Myles Door Lever with Modern Rectangle Roses,"
            },
